1753..1824 Comment "/// The single-substitution calculus of the pure λ-calculus: contexts,"
1825..1898 Comment "/// substitutions between them and terms in a context; the empty context,"
1899..1974 Comment "/// substitution, context extension, weakening, the newest variable, single"
1975..2041 Comment "/// substitution and lifting; abstraction and application; the six"
2042..2116 Comment "/// substitution laws. Law 3 moves a weakening past a lift and back, so no"
2117..2194 Comment "/// path order orients it and the rules are refused; `Model(LC)` derives from"
2195..2222 Comment "/// the block all the same."
